e6b85ea [roha]    sloppy-bot appears as a normal “account” in `accounts.json`. Add an entry so Fountain can
e6b85ea [roha]    route traffic to it: ```json "discord": { "api": "Sloppy", "env": "DISCORD_BOT", "emoji":
e6b85ea [roha]    "🦜", "platform": "https://discord.com/channels/…" } ``` The `DISCORD_BOT` environment
e6b85ea [roha]    variable must contain the bot token. Restart both services after any change; the bot will
