e6dc63c [gpt-5-2025] #
e6dc63c [gpt-5-2025] #When a shallow copy is better
e6dc63c [gpt-5-2025] #- Future refactors might accidentally keep mutating the same object instance before reassigning.
e6dc63c [gpt-5-2025] #- If tags values are distinct objects per session (as in your code), a shallow copy is enough to
