e6e1fc6 [gpt-5-nano] #- Path handling: builds HostDir with HOME/HOMEPATH; Windows paths use forward slashes, which Deno
e6e1fc6 [gpt-5-nano] #handles but might surprise on some shells.
e6e1fc6 [gpt-5-nano] #- NDJSON flow: /announce and JSON blocks get forwarded to Fountain; non-JSON lines are treated as
e6e1fc6 [gpt-5-nano] #chat input.
e6e1fc7 [gpt-5-nano] #- Client handling: per-session 관리 via SSHSession; supports PTY, env vars, and shell input.
