e6e1fc7 [gpt-5-nano] #- NDJSON parsing: NDJSON expects exact boundaries; consider tolerant parsing or a delimiter
e6e1fc7 [gpt-5-nano] #protocol to handle partial chunks safely.
e6e1fc7 [gpt-5-nano] #- Error handling: when writeFountain or fountain I/O fails, bubble up a clean error instead of
