e7cafee [roha]    # nitrologic-forge CLI Reference Manual The forge text interfaces is designed for research
e7cafee [roha]    tools such as Slop Fountain⛲ to chat and share files with models under test. It is designed to
e7cafee [roha]    be human usable adopting traditional platforms where appropriate. Commands with no arguments
e7cafee [roha]    may often prompt for a # index from the items displayed. ### /config Toggle configuration
