e7d4868 [roha]    # nitrologic-forge CLI Reference Manual The forge text interfaces is designed for research
e7d4868 [roha]    tools such as Slop Fountain⛲ to chat and share files with models under test. It is designed to
e7d4868 [roha]    be human usable adopting traditional platforms where appropriate. Commands with no arguments
e7d4868 [roha]    may often prompt for a # index from the items displayed. ### /config Toggle configuration
e7d4868 [roha]    flags. Default values are typically: * 0 squash : squash message sequences in output : false *
e7d4868 [roha]    1 reasonoutloud : echo chain of thought : false * 2 tools : enable model tool interface :
e7d4868 [roha]    false * 3 commitonstart : commit shared files on start : true * 4 saveonexit : save
e7d4868 [roha]    conversation history on exit : false * 5 ansi : markdown ANSI rendering : true * 6 verbose :
e7d4868 [roha]    emit debug information : false * 7 broken : ansi background blocks : false * 8 logging : log
e7d4868 [roha]    all output to file : true * 9 debugging : emit diagnostics : false * 10 pushonshare : emit a
e7d4868 [roha]    /push after any /share : false * 11 rawprompt : experimental rawmode stdin - broken paste :
e7d4868 [roha]    true * 12 resetcounters : factory reset when reset : false * 13 returntopush : hit return to
e7d4868 [roha]    /push - under test : false * 14 slow : experimental output at reading speed : false * 15 slops
e7d4868 [roha]    : console worker scripts : false ### /temp Set or show the persona settings temperature. Temp
e7d4868 [roha]    is an entropy control, use lower values for focus, higher for creativity. ### /share /attach
e7d4868 [roha]    Share a file or folder with optional tag. Files are added to the share list used by the /push
e7d4868 [roha]    /commit command. A 🔗 signifies file share is included in current context. Valid extensions
e7d4868 [roha]    for image files are .jpg and .png. ### /drop Drop all files currently shared, reduce the
e7d4868 [roha]    context and save tokens. Work in progress, see /reset for a simple alternative. ### /push
e7d4868 [roha]    /commit Refresh shared files. Detects changes or
