e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #
e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #arrives in rohaHistory as:
e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #
e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #
e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #role="user", name="PORT", content="...something..."
e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #
e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #
e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #So “PORT” is not a real person—it’s just the placeholder name used for messages that originate from
e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #the application itself (network errors, tool-call failures, etc.).
e806531 [kimi-k2-0905] #
