e844a90 [kimi-k2-0905] #In sloppylisten.ts the exit path is:
e844a90 [kimi-k2-0905] #
e844a90 [kimi-k2-0905] #1. User types “exit”
e844a90 [kimi-k2-0905] #2. `onShell` sees the CR, `onEnter()` is called
e844a90 [kimi-k2-0905] #3. `onEnter` matches “exit”, prints “Goodbye!\r\n” and calls `this.stream?.end()`
e844a90 [kimi-k2-0905] #4. `stream.on("end")` fires → `connection.end()` runs
e844a90 [kimi-k2-0905] #5. `connection.end()` deletes the session from the `connections` map and logs “Session closed”
e844a90 [kimi-k2-0905] #
e844a90 [kimi-k2-0905] #No other cleanup is required; the SSH client socket is closed automatically when the stream ends.
