f50ac2e [nitro@ryzen5] i need you to analyse the tool calling code for reasons why multiple calls to read_time were made
f50ad4e [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #Multiple `read_time` hits trace back to `relay()` + `processToolCalls()`:
f50ad4e [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #
f50ad4e [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #1. `relay()` always includes `payload.tools` whenever `roha.config.tools` and `grokFunctions` are
f50ad4e [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #on, so every completion opportunity can ask for `read_time`.
f50ad4e [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #2. When a completion contains `choice.message.toolcalls`, `processToolCalls()` runs the
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #function and pushes the result to history, then `relay()` recursively calls itself (`await
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #relay(depth+1)`) without muting the tool flag or removing the original user prompt. The next
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #recursive request still contains the same user message plus the latest tool result, so the model
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #(still in tool-call mode) can ask for `readtime` again, triggering another recursion.
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #3. There’s no guard to stop calling tools on each nested relay depth, so if the model doesn’t emit
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #a final text reply after each result (or keeps re-requesting the tool), you get a chain of repeated
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #`read_time` calls—75 in your log.
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #Fixing it means:
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #- Only add `rohaTools` when you expect the model to call them and clear them once a tool result
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #satisfies the request.
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #- Stop the recursion once a tool result has been inserted (or track which tool calls have already
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #been answered) so the prompt doesn’t keep asking for the same function.
f50ad4f [gpt-5.1-codex-mini] #
f50ad4f [roha] {account:openai,spent:0.0159,cached:0.0000,balance:-11.2745}
f50ad4f [roha]  ꔀ Fountain 1.5.7 ⛲  gpt-5.1-codex-mini 🕸️ 0.7° $0.016 🪠 185.4KB 17.51s
