f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #Console path (five-click habit)
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #1. Open EC2 → Launch instance
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #2. Choose AMI (Amazon-Linux-2023), instance type (m5.large), key pair
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #3. Advanced details → IAM instance profile → Create role
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #   - Service: EC2
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #   - Permissions: add `AmazonSSMManagedInstanceCore` (for Session Manager) plus your tiny game
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #policy (`DescribeInstances`, `DescribeTags`)
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #   - Name it `GameNodeRole` → Create → refresh → pick it
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #4. Storage (30 GB gp3), Network (pick SG with 22 and your game port)
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #5. Launch
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #You now have a console-launched node that already carries an IAM role.
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #Adopt IAM-role sessions (no SSH keys)
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c918 [kimi-k2-0905] #1. In the same console left-nav open Systems Manager → Session Manager → Start session →
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #pick your instance → “Start session”.
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #   You’re in a root shell through the browser; no SSH, no keys, traffic over TLS to SSM endpoints.
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #2. Inside the instance use AWS CLI without keys:
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #aws sts get-caller-identity
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] ## → shows GameNodeRole assumed via EC2
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #aws ec2 describe-tags --region ap-southeast-1
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #3. From now on launch every spot via console or CLI with `--iam-instance-profile
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #Name=GameNodeRole`; every node inherits the same trust chain and you manage them all through
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #Session Manager.
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #Done—console first, IAM sessions forever.
f90c919 [kimi-k2-0905] #
