fa456cd [kimi-k2-0905] #None in that table—every engine listed is C/C++ and interpreter-only, so they build
fa456cd [kimi-k2-0905] #and run on any 32- or 64-bit target (ARM64, x86-64, RISC-V, …) with nothing more than a
