fa457f7 [kimi-k2-0905] #Correct—none of the engines in the table include a JIT.
fa457f7 [kimi-k2-0905] #They are all pure interpreters designed for size, not speed, so they compile cleanly for any 32- or
fa457f7 [kimi-k2-0905] #64-bit ISA with no extra backend.
fa457f7 [kimi-k2-0905] #
