102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Option 1 – H1 with Inspire-style dexterous hands
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Unitree’s H1 ships as a 23-DoF torso/leg robot, but the factory wrist plates are already drilled
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #for the Inspire-Robotics 11-DoF hand (6 DoF thumb + 5×1 DoF fingers).
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Adding two hands gives 45 DoF total: keep the existing 23, add 2×11 = 22 more.
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Joints you’d need to list:
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #- 7-DoF arm chain (shoulder×3, elbow×1, wrist×3) – already present in SDK URDF
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #- 11-DoF hand: thumbbase, thumbprox, thumbmid, thumbdist, indexmeta,
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #indexprox, indexmid, middlemeta, middleprox, middlemid,
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #ringpinkycoupled.
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Rest pose is the same T-pose arms as H1 base, fingers curled 5° so the wireframe looks “relaxed”
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #but collision-free.
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Option 2 – Apollo / Optimus modular palm topology
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Apptronik Apollo and Tesla Optimus both use a 6-DoF palm (3-axis wrist + 3-axis palm gimbal) and
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #five 1-DoF tendoned fingers (total 11 per hand).
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Whole-body count: 23 (torso/legs) + 2×11 = 45 DoF—same as option 1, but the kinematic style is
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #different:
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #- Palm gimbal lets the hand rotate around the tool centre point without arm motion—good for
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #valve-turning or using tools.
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #- Fingers are coupled (single actuator closes all joints), so you only list one joint per finger.
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Rest pose: arms slightly forward, palms facing inward, fingers straight but with 3 mm pre-tension
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #so the tendon is seated.
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #Either block slots straight into the topologies object using the same coordinate system and units
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #you already have.
102bae20 [kimi-k2-0905] #
