107affde [gemini-3-pro] #   | (Signal to Non-Inv +)  |                |                |                |
107affde [gemini-3-pro] #[LM319 U1-A]             [LM319 U1-B]     [LM319 U2-A]     [LM319 U2-B]     [LM319 U2-B]
107affde [gemini-3-pro] #   (+) Pin 4                (+) Pin 9        (+) Pin 4        (+) Pin 9
107affdf [gemini-3-pro] #
107affdf [gemini-3-pro] #
107affdf [gemini-3-pro] #• Comparator Configuration (LM319):*
