107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• RCA Jack (Signal): Connect to Line_In.
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• RCA Jack (GND): Connect to Common Ground.
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• Termination: Connect 75 $\Omega$ Resistor between Line_In and Ground.
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• Coupling: Connect Line_In to Comparator Inputs (Direct DC coupling assumed per
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #your note).
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2. Comparator Setup (2x LM319)*
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• Power: Connect LM319 VCC pins to 5V. Connect GND pins to Ground.
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• Decoupling: Place 0.1 $\mu$F capacitors between VCC and GND near each chip.
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• 3. Reference Voltage Generation*
