107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #Ground. Connect the junction (~0.3V) to LM319 Input 1 Reference.
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• Luma Levels (G0, G1, G2): Connect the outer legs of the 3x 10k Trimmers to 5V and Ground.
