107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• 4. Signal Comparison & Output*
107b1a37 [gemini-3-pro] #• Signal Distribution: Connect the buffered/coupled Line_In to the other
107b1a38 [gemini-3-pro] #input pin of all 4 comparators.
107b1a38 [gemini-3-pro] #• Outputs (Open Collector):
107b1a38 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Connect LM319 Output pins to Pico GPIO pins (e.g., GP0, GP1, GP2, GP3).
107b1a38 [gemini-3-pro] #       Connect a 2.2k $\Omega$ - 4.7k $\Omega$ resistor from each* Output pin to Pico
107b1a38 [gemini-3-pro] #3.3V (3V3_OUT).
107b1a38 [gemini-3-pro] #       Warning:* Do not pull up to 5V, or you will damage the Pico.
