107b77f5 [gemini-3-pro] #Here are the pin assignments for the LM319 High Speed Dual Comparator in the standard
107b77f5 [gemini-3-pro] #DIP-14 package (commonly sold by retailers like Jaycar).
107b77f5 [gemini-3-pro] #
107b77f5 [gemini-3-pro] #• LM319 Pinout (DIP-14)*
107b77f5 [gemini-3-pro] #
107b77f5 [gemini-3-pro] #╭──────────┬────────────────┬─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
