107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **4**   │  **IN 1 (+)**  │  Comparator 1 Non-Inverting Input                       │
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **5**   │  **IN 1 (-)**  │  Comparator 1 Inverting Input                           │
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **6**   │  **V-**        │  Negative Supply (Connect to Ground for single supply)  │
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **7**   │  **OUT 1**     │  Comparator 1 Output (Open Collector)                   │
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **8**   │  NC            │  No Connection                                          │
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **9**   │  **OUT 2**     │  Comparator 2 Output (Open Collector)                   │
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **10**  │  **IN 2 (-)**  │  Comparator 2 Inverting Input                           │
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **11**  │  **IN 2 (+)**  │  Comparator 2 Non-Inverting Input                       │
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **12**  │  **V+**        │  Positive Supply (Connect to +5V)                       │
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #│  **13**  │  NC            │  No Connection                                          │
