107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #Connection Notes for LUMA 2 (5V Single Supply)
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #• V+ (Pin 12): Connect to your 5V rail.
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #• V- (Pin 6) & GND (Pin 3): Connect both to Ground.
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #• Outputs (Pins 7 & 9): Connect these to the Pico GPIOs. Ensure your pull-up
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #resistors (2.2kΩ - 4.7kΩ) go from these pins to the 3.3V rail (not 5V) to protect the
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #Pico inputs.
107b77f6 [gemini-3-pro] #
