107e75d1 [claude-opus-4-5] #The shared files show a sophisticated multi-model LLM research tool (Slop Fountain) and its Unix
107e75d1 [claude-opus-4-5] #socket server component (SloppyPipe).
107e75d1 [claude-opus-4-5] #
107e75d1 [claude-opus-4-5] #• slopfountain.ts* - Main application (~2800 lines)
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Multi-provider support: OpenAI, Anthropic, Google Gemini, DeepSeek
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Tool calling with function declarations
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- File sharing with caching (SHA-256 hashing)
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Session history management with squashing
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- TTS integration (GPT voices, Gemini voices)
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- ANSI/markdown rendering with table box drawing
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Configuration flags system
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Cost tracking per model/account
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #• sloppypipe.ts* - Socket relay (~120 lines)
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Unix domain socket server at `/tmp/sloppy.sock`
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Bridges external connections to Fountain
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Simple session management via `connections` record
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #Notable patterns:
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Uses `rid` property on connections (Deno 1.x API - deprecated in Deno 2)
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Named functions throughout as preferred
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Tab indentation consistent
107e75d2 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Heavy use of async/await with Promise.race for multiplexing
107e75d4 [claude-opus-4-5] #
107e75d4 [claude-opus-4-5] #The `rid` usage in sloppypipe.ts may need updating for Deno 2.x compatibility since resource IDs
107e75d4 [claude-opus-4-5] #were removed. The connection object itself should be used as the key instead.
107e75d4 [claude-opus-4-5] #
