108cf5a8 [claude-opus-4-5] #
108cf5a8 [claude-opus-4-5] #Your 2-bit luma is non-standard - you'd likely present it as:
108cf5a8 [claude-opus-4-5] #
108cf5a8 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Raw bulk endpoint - custom driver/software
108cf5a8 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Expand to 8-bit Y-only (Y800/GREY format) on the RP2040 before sending as UVC
108cf5a8 [claude-opus-4-5] #
108cf5a8 [claude-opus-4-5] #Y800/GREY is 8-bit luma only, no chroma - closest standard thing to "Y:0:0". You'd just scale your
108cf5a8 [claude-opus-4-5] #2-bit (0-3) to 8-bit (0,85,170,255).
