10930bbf [claude-opus-4-5] #Running LM319 off 5V VBUS is fine - they're specced down to single 5V supply.
10930bbf [claude-opus-4-5] #
10930bbf [claude-opus-4-5] #• You'll need:*
10930bbf [claude-opus-4-5] #
