10930e70 [claude-opus-4-5] #threshold drifts or gets bumped, you lose sync entirely rather than just getting slightly wrong
10930e70 [claude-opus-4-5] #gray mapping. A fixed threshold is one less thing to go wrong.
10930e70 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10930e71 [claude-opus-4-5] #• Middle ground option:* Use a trimpot for CSYNC but a multi-turn one for finer adjustment
10930e71 [claude-opus-4-5] #and better stability, keep the single-turn Pihers for the gray levels where exact setting is less
