1093204b [claude-opus-4-5] #them down fine, but rise time will be slower than with discrete 4.7K pull-ups.
1093204b [claude-opus-4-5] #
1093204b [claude-opus-4-5] #At the speeds you're dealing with (6MHz-ish pixel rate, sync edges) it might matter. Slow rise time
1093204b [claude-opus-4-5] #could give you mushy edge detection in the PIO.
1093204b [claude-opus-4-5] #
1093204b [claude-opus-4-5] #• Try it first* with internal pull-ups - if you get glitchy sync or noisy gray transitions,
1093204b [claude-opus-4-5] #add external 4.7K pull-ups. Easy fix later if needed.
1093204b [claude-opus-4-5] #
