109697ff [claude-opus-4-5] #need to be snappy.
109697ff [claude-opus-4-5] #
109697ff [claude-opus-4-5] #• The 74LVC245 choice for output* - good call on LVC for the 3.3V to 5V direction, though
109697ff [claude-opus-4-5] #you'll want to verify the C64 bus can handle the drive characteristics. The original cartridge port
