10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #Yes, the Commodore 1540 was the disk drive released specifically for the VIC-20. It
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #is mechanically identical to the 1541 but the ROM timing is slightly faster. The C64's VIC-II video
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #chip steals bus cycles, making the C64 too slow to talk to a stock 1540, forcing Commodore to slow
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #down the protocol for the 1541.
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #Regarding the PIO: It runs at system clock speed (125MHz+). It can shift registers
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #continuously at tens of megahertz. It is vastly faster than the IEC bus (which runs at ~1-2kHz
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #standard, or ~10-20kHz fast serial).
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #Since the IEC bus is slow and only has a few lines, dropping the shift register is the right design
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #choice.
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #Signals to Drive Low (Open Collector/Drain)
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #The IEC bus is Open Collector. The lines are pulled up to 5V by the computer/drive and
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #devices pull them to Ground to signal `0` or `Active`.
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #If acting as a Device (Disk Drive):
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #1.  DATA: Must be able to pull Low (to send data and acknowledge attention).
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #2.  CLK: Must be able to pull Low (to send data).
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #3.  SRQ: (Optional) Used for C128 "Fast Serial" mode.
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #4.  ATN: Read-only (The computer drives this low to command devices).
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #5.  RESET: Read-only (Usually).
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #If acting as a Controller (The Computer):
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #1.  ATN: Must be able to pull Low.
10a0cb55 [gemini-3-pro] #2.  CLK: Must be able to pull Low.
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #3.  DATA: Must be able to pull Low.
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #Here is the updated project file using voltage dividers and direct GPIO.
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #Project Fifteen
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #A RP2040 Commodore Serial IEC Bus emulator (Device Mode).
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #[USB] ─ RP2040 ─ [Level Shifters] ─ DIN-6 ─ [C64/VIC-20]
