10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #5x 3.3kΩ Resistors (Voltage Divider Bottom - Input)
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #3x 100Ω Resistors (Gate protection for FETs, optional but recommended)
10a0cb56 [gemini-3-pro] #1x 20-pin female header, Pico socket
