10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #Project Fifteen
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #• RP2040 Commodore Serial Bus (IEC) Emulator*
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #To answer your questions:
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #1.  1540 Model: Yes, the VIC-1540 was the companion drive for the VIC-20. It runs slightly
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #faster than the 1541 because the VIC-20 didn't require the "slow down" code added for the C64's
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #video chip timing.
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #2.  PIO Speed: The RP2040 PIO runs at system clock speed (default 125MHz). It can sample or
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #toggle pins every cycle (8ns). This is orders of magnitude faster than the IEC bus (standard
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #~1-2kHz, Fast Serial ~20-80kHz).
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #3.  Signals to Drive: As a device (Drive), you must be able to pull DATA and
10a0ed77 [gemini-3-pro] #CLK low. For Fast Serial (C128/1571/1581), you also drive SRQ. Driving ATN
10a0ed78 [gemini-3-pro] #allows the RP2040 to act as a Host (Computer) or signal requests, so 4 FETs is the correct choice
10a0ed78 [gemini-3-pro] #for full flexibility.
10a0ed78 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0ed78 [gemini-3-pro] #Netlist (CSV)
10a0ed78 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a0ed78 [gemini-3-pro] #
