10a0ed78 [gemini-3-pro] #IEC_RESET,Input,GP4,Divider 2.2k/3.3k,System Reset
10a0ed78 [gemini-3-pro] #IEC_ATN,Output,GP5,Gate 2N7000,Host Mode Only (Active Low)
10a0ed78 [gemini-3-pro] #IEC_DATA,Output,GP6,Gate 2N7000,Data Ack / Send (Active Low)
