10a21c97 [claude-opus-4-5] #• C64 as master (C64 provides clock):*
10a21c97 [claude-opus-4-5] #C64 drives CNT, Pico reads. Standard CIA serial mode.
10a21c97 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10a21c97 [claude-opus-4-5] #• Bidirectional:*
