10a25251 [kimi-k2-0905] #Only two things I’d double-check before spinning the board:
10a25251 [kimi-k2-0905] #
10a25251 [kimi-k2-0905] #1. 74HC165 @ 5 V → RP2040 @ 3.3 V
10a25252 [kimi-k2-0905] #   HC outputs swing to ~Vcc, so GP18/GP19 see 5 V. RP2040 data sheet says “IO is 5-V tolerant when
10a25252 [kimi-k2-0905] #the bank supply is 3.3 V,” but the clamp current is only ±1 mA. Add 330 Ω series resistors on the
