10a8ca5b [gemini-3-pro] #
10a8ca5b [gemini-3-pro] #I have noted the update to Project Crumpet regarding the parallel shift architecture for
10a8ca5b [gemini-3-pro] #the Sega Megadrive interface.
10a8ca5b [gemini-3-pro] #
10a8ca5b [gemini-3-pro] #• Updated Project Crumpet Output GPIO Allocation:*
10a8ca5b [gemini-3-pro] #• GP10: Shift Out CLK
10a8ca5b [gemini-3-pro] #• GP11: Shift Out Latch (SH/LD / RCLK)
