10a8d6e9 [nitro@ryzen5] to emulate a cartridge please detail steps in series of csv
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #Here is the step-by-step procedure to emulate a Megadrive cartridge read cycle using the Project
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #Crumpet hardware, formatted as a CSV.
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #Step,Phase,GPIO Action,Description
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #1,Idle,Monitor GP9 (Control Stream),Wait for /CE (Cartridge Enable) bit to go LOW indicating bus access start.
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #2,Snapshot,Pulse GP3 (In_SH/LD) LOW then HIGH,Latch current state of Address Bus, Data Bus, and Control signals into 74HC165s.
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #3,Ingest,Loop 8 times: Read GP4-GP9; Pulse GP2 (In_CLK),Parallel shift-in of 6 bytes (48 bits) covering A1-A23, D0-D15, and Controls in 8 clock cycles.
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #4,Decode,Internal CPU Logic,Reconstruct 23-bit Address and Control flags. Verify Read cycle (/OE is Active).
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #5,Fetch,Internal CPU Logic,Retrieve 16-bit data word from RP2040 RAM/Flash array based on decoded Address.
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #6,Serialize,Loop 8 times: Set GP13 (Data L) & GP14 (Data H); Pulse GP10 (Out_CLK),Shift retrieved 16-bit word into the two 74HC595 registers (8 bits per line simultaneously).
10a8d8c8 [gemini-3-pro] #7,Stage,Pulse GP11 (Out_SH/LD),Transfer shifted data from 595 shift register to storage register (Outputs remain High-Z).
10a8d8c9 [gemini-3-pro] #8,Drive,Set GP12 (Out_OE) LOW,Enable 74HC595 output buffers to drive D0-D15 lines on the Megadrive bus.
10a8d8c9 [gemini-3-pro] #9,Ack,Set Open Drain GPIO LOW,Assert /DTACK (Data Acknowledge) to signal Megadrive 68000 that valid data is on the bus.
10a8d8c9 [gemini-3-pro] #10,Hold,Monitor GP9 (via periodic re-snapshot) or GP15 (CLK),Wait for /CE or /AS to go HIGH indicating cycle completion.
10a8d8c9 [gemini-3-pro] #11,Release,Set GP12 (Out_OE) HIGH,Disable 74HC595 output buffers (High-Z) to free the Data Bus.
10a8d8c9 [gemini-3-pro] #12,Reset Ack,Set Open Drain GPIO HIGH-Z,De-assert /DTACK.
10a8d8c9 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a8d8c9 [gemini-3-pro] #
