10a8f0c9 [gemini-3-pro] #│  GP17  │  /CART             │  Output     │  Gate 2N7000 (Active High GPIO)               │
10a8f0c9 [gemini-3-pro] #│  GP23  │  SMPS PS           │  Output     │  Power save                                   │
