10a8fa8a [gemini-3-pro] #latency), you must hold this high (floating) until the shift-out is complete, then pull Low.
10a8fa8a [gemini-3-pro] #2.  /CART (Cartridge Detect): Required. This is a static signal usually tied to
10a8fa8a [gemini-3-pro] #ground on real carts. The RP2040 can pull this low to simulate "insertion."
