10a90988 [gemini-3-pro] #1.  /DTACK (Data Transfer Acknowledge): The 68000 asserts /AS (Address Strobe). The
10a90988 [gemini-3-pro] #cartridge must assert /DTACK low when data is on the bus. If the RP2040 takes time to fetch data,
10a90988 [gemini-3-pro] #delaying /DTACK effectively pauses the CPU (wait states).
10a90988 [gemini-3-pro] #2.  /CART (Cartridge Detect): Must be pulled low for the Megadrive to recognize a cartridge
10a90988 [gemini-3-pro] #is inserted.
