10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #3, PIO loop, PIO_IN clock & read 8 bits, Parallel read 6 pins (A1-A23 + Ctrl)
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #4, ARM core, Decode Address, Map A1-A23 to ROM array index
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #5, ARM core, Fetch Data, Get 16-bit word
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #6, ARM core, Push to TX FIFO, Send to PIO_OUT
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #7, PIO_OUT, Shift out 8 bits, Parallel write 2 pins (D0-D7 + D8-D15) to 74HC595s
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #8, PIO_OUT, Pulse Latch, Transfer shift register to storage register
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #9, PIO_OUT, Enable /OE, Drive 74HC595 outputs onto Data Bus
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #10, GPIO, Assert /DTACK LOW, Signal CPU that data is valid
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #11, /CE rises, Release /DTACK, Set to High-Z (Input)
