10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #Timing and PIO Strategy
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #The timing is tight but feasible. The 68000 bus cycle is approximately 500ns.
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #• Shift In (8 cycles):*
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #Using PIO with `sideset`, you can toggle the clock pin during the input instruction. You do
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #not need NOPs; the 74HC series can handle ~20MHz+, and the RP2040 at 125MHz+ is fast enough to
10a90989 [gemini-3-pro] #drive it.
