10a9bb17 [gemini-3-pro] #Here is the updated BOM and Netlist for Project Crumpet using the Jaycar 74LS374s.
10a9bb17 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb17 [gemini-3-pro] #Project Crumpet (LS374 Edition)
10a9bb17 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• Change:* Replaces output shift registers with parallel latches for faster writing.
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #BOM Updates
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• Remove: 2x 74LVC245 / 74HC595
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• Add: 2x 74LS374 (Octal D Flip-Flop 3-State) - Jaycar Cat# ZL3374
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• Logic: 74LS374 VCC must be 5V.
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #GPIO Allocation (Re-mapped)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #To accommodate the 8-bit parallel data bus, the input shift registers are now fully daisy-chained
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #(1 pin reading) instead of parallel groups.
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP0: UART TX
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP1: UART RX
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP2: 165 Shift CLK (Common)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP3: 165 Shift SH/LD (Common)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP4: 165 Data In (Reading Q7 from last shift register U6)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP5: 374 Latch Low Byte (CLK U7)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP6: 374 Latch High Byte (CLK U8)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP7: 374 Output Enable (/OC Common)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP8: Data 0 (Out)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP9: Data 1 (Out)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP10: Data 2 (Out)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP11: Data 3 (Out)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP12: Data 4 (Out)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP13: Data 5 (Out)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP14: Data 6 (Out)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP15: Data 7 (Out)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP16: /DTACK (Open Drain FET)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP17: /CART (Open Drain FET)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP18: MD CLK Input (Voltage Divider)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #Netlist: 74LS374 (Write Path)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• U7 - Low Byte Latch (D0-D7)*
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• 1 (/OC): GP7 (Output Enable)
10a9bb18 [gemini-3-pro] #• 11 (CLK): GP5 (Latch Low)
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 3, 4, 7, 8, 13, 14, 17, 18 (D0-D7 Inputs): Connect to RP2040 GP8 - GP15
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2, 5, 6, 9, 12, 15, 16, 19 (Q0-Q7 Outputs): Connect to Megadrive D0 - D7
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 10 (GND): GND
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 20 (VCC): +5V
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• U8 - High Byte Latch (D8-D15)*
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 1 (/OC): GP7 (Output Enable)
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 11 (CLK): GP6 (Latch High)
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 3, 4, 7, 8, 13, 14, 17, 18 (D0-D7 Inputs): Connect to RP2040 GP8 - GP15
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2, 5, 6, 9, 12, 15, 16, 19 (Q0-Q7 Outputs): Connect to Megadrive D8 - D15
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 10 (GND): GND
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• 20 (VCC): +5V
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #Netlist: 74HC165 (Read Path - Daisy Chained)
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• U1 (Addr Lo): Input pins to MD A1-A8. Q7 (9) connects to U2 DS (10).
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• U2 (Addr Mid): Input pins to MD A9-A16. Q7 (9) connects to U3 DS (10).
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• U3 (Addr Hi): Input pins to MD A17-A23. Q7 (9) connects to U4 DS (10).
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• U4 (Data Lo): Input pins to MD D0-D7. Q7 (9) connects to U5 DS (10).
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• U5 (Data Hi): Input pins to MD D8-D15. Q7 (9) connects to U6 DS (10).
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• U6 (Control): Input pins to MD Control. Q7 (9) connects to RP2040 GP4.
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #• All U1-U6: Pin 1 (SH/LD) to GP3. Pin 2 (CLK) to GP2.
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #Write Sequence Logic
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #1.  Set Data: Write Low Byte to GP8-15.
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #2.  Latch Low: Pulse GP5 (Low -> High).
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #3.  Set Data: Write High Byte to GP8-15.
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #4.  Latch High: Pulse GP6 (Low -> High).
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #5.  Enable: Set GP7 Low (Drives 5V bus).
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #6.  Handshake: Assert /DTACK.
10a9bb19 [gemini-3-pro] #
