10a9e109 [gemini-3-pro] #The BOM specifies 74LS374 (Parallel Latches), but the Logic Steps and Component details
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #describe 74HC595 (Serial Shift Registers) behavior. Additionally, GP16/GP17 are
