10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #Conflicts Found
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #1.  Output Architecture:
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #       List:* GP10–GP17 assigned to `Latch D0-D7` (Parallel).
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #       Logic/Netlist:* GP10 assigned as `SRCLK`, GP13/14 as `SER` data lines (Serial).
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #2.  Double Booking (GP16/GP17):
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #       List:* GP16/17 are `Latch D6/D7`.
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #       FET Section:* GP16/17 are `/DTACK` and `/CART`.
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #       Resolution:* Move FETs to GP21/GP22 as per the GPIO List.
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #3.  Component Type:
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #       Netlist:* Refers to U7/U8 inputs as `SER` (Serial Pin 14 on a 595).
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #       BOM:* Refers to U7/U8 as 74LS374 (Parallel D-Flip Flops).
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9e10a [gemini-3-pro] #Consolidated GPIO Allocation (Project Crumpet)
