10a9e10b [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9e10b [gemini-3-pro] #Updated Logic Steps (Parallel Write)
10a9e10b [gemini-3-pro] #1.  Idle: Listen to U6 (Control) stream.
10a9e10b [gemini-3-pro] #2.  Decode: Determine 16-bit word to write.
10a9e10c [gemini-3-pro] #3.  Write Low: Put Low Byte on `GP10-GP17`, Pulse `GP18` (CP_LO).
10a9e10c [gemini-3-pro] #4.  Write High: Put High Byte on `GP10-GP17`, Pulse `GP19` (CP_HI).
10a9e10c [gemini-3-pro] #5.  Drive: Pull `GP20` (/OE) LOW.
10a9e10c [gemini-3-pro] #6.  Ack: Pull `GP21` (/DTACK) HIGH (FET ON -> Bus Low).
10a9e10c [gemini-3-pro] #7.  Hold: Wait for cycle end.
10a9e10c [gemini-3-pro] #8.  Release: Release `GP21`, Release `GP20`.
10a9e10c [gemini-3-pro] #
