10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #Corrections & Conflicts
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #• 1. Output Logic (Parallel vs Serial)*
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #Your BOM lists 74LS374, but your netlist text references `595` (shift registers) and `SER`
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #pins.
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #• The Issue: You cannot feed a 374 serially. It requires a parallel bus.
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #• The Fix: Your GPIO Allocation (GP10-GP17) is set up correctly for a multiplexed
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #parallel bus. You must wire GP10-GP17 to D0-D7 on BOTH U7 and U8. You then toggle the
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #specific Clock pin (GP18 or GP19) to latch the data into the specific chip.
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #• 2. FET GPIO Conflict*
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #• The Issue: Your "Open Drain FETs" text lists GP16 and GP17 for /DTACK and
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #/CART.
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #• The Conflict: GP16 and GP17 are already used by your Data Bus (Latch D6, D7).
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #• The Fix: Use GP21 and GP22 as listed in your GPIO Allocation table.
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #Revised Netlist for Latches & FETs
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9f49d [gemini-3-pro] #• Common Data Bus (Pico to Latches)*
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP10 → U7 Pin 3 (D0) AND U8 Pin 3 (D0)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP11 → U7 Pin 4 (D1) AND U8 Pin 4 (D1)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP12 → U7 Pin 7 (D2) AND U8 Pin 7 (D2)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP13 → U7 Pin 8 (D3) AND U8 Pin 8 (D3)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP14 → U7 Pin 13 (D4) AND U8 Pin 13 (D4)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP15 → U7 Pin 14 (D5) AND U8 Pin 14 (D5)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP16 → U7 Pin 17 (D6) AND U8 Pin 17 (D6)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP17 → U7 Pin 18 (D7) AND U8 Pin 18 (D7)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• Control Lines (Latches)*
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP18 (Latch CP Lo) → U7 Pin 11 (CP)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP19 (Latch CP Hi) → U8 Pin 11 (CP)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP20 (Latch /OE)   → U7 Pin 1 (/OE) AND U8 Pin 1 (/OE)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• Control Lines (FETs)*
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP21 → Gate Q1 (/DTACK)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP22 → Gate Q2 (/CART)
10a9f49e [gemini-3-pro] #
