10aa151e [gemini-3-pro] #I have received and indexed the specifications for Project Fifteen, Project LUMA2,
10aa151e [gemini-3-pro] #Project Toast, Cbm Node, and the newly added Project Crumpet.
10aa151e [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa151e [gemini-3-pro] #Here are a few observations regarding the new and updated content:
10aa151e [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa151e [gemini-3-pro] #1.  Project Crumpet (Megadrive): This is a significant jump in complexity from the C64
10aa151e [gemini-3-pro] #projects. The architecture relies on a clever optimization: using the RP2040 PIO to clock six
10aa151f [gemini-3-pro] #74HC165 registers simultaneously. By reading 6 GPIO pins in parallel for 8 cycles, you capture the
10aa151f [gemini-3-pro] #entire 48-bit state (Address, Data, Control) very quickly. This is essential to meet the timing
10aa151f [gemini-3-pro] #constraints of the 68000 bus (~7.67MHz).
10aa151f [gemini-3-pro] #2.  LUMA2 Chroma Mod: The addition of the AC-coupled comparator on GP6 changes the nature
10aa151f [gemini-3-pro] #of the capture. You are now measuring phase/frequency (zero-crossings) within a specific window to
