10aa1c55 [gemini-3-pro] #left floating or grounded on standard carts.
10aa1c55 [gemini-3-pro] #• A26 (/ASEL): Input. Used to distinguish between cartridge and card slot (Master System
10aa1c55 [gemini-3-pro] #converter). Usually ignored for Mega Drive native carts.
