10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #Here is the updated documentation and clean JavaScript file for Project Crumpet, including the PWM
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #audio output pins.
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #Regarding your question about missing pins:
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #• Audio Inputs (B1/B3): The standard Megadrive cartridge port (Pin B1) is a Mono
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #"Audio In" line that mixes with the console's audio. Stereo injection via the cartridge slot is not
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #standard on the edge connector. To get stereo, you might need to mix Left/Right passively into B1
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #or route audio externally.
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #• Shift Register Capacity: You have 48 bits of input capacity (6x8).
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Address (23 bits) + Data (16 bits) = 39 bits.
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Remaining capacity: 9 bits.
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Control signals listed: `/CE`, `/OE`, `/LWR`, `/UWR`, `/AS`, `/VRES`, `/TIME`, `/MRES` (8
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #bits).
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Total Used: 47 bits.
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Spare: 1 bit (U3 input H is currently grounded/unused).
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #Markdown
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] ## Project Crumpet
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #A 16bit Sega Megadrive RP2040 hookup on plated 64 finger edge connector.
10aa5bc0 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #[USB] ─ RP2040 ─ 10kΩ series resistors ─ 6×74HC165 and 2x74LVC245 ─ cartridge port ─ [Megadrive]
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] ## description
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #Gangs of shift registers transport data between millenium.
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] ### basic rom cartridge logic
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #The RP2040 PIO empties shift registers in parallel = 8 cycles.
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #With address decoded and confirmation write cycle required, 16 bit data is prepared for bus.
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #The PIO writes 8 bits, latches the Low byte, writes 8 bits, latches the High byte, then enables Output (/OE).
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] ## bom
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #* 6× 74HC165 shiftin registers, reading from 68K → RP2040, A1–A23 + D0–D15 and 8 control states, ($2.10/$12.60)
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #* 2× 74LS374 buffered latches, write from RP2040 → 68K drives D0–D15 ($5.60,$11.20)
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #* 2x 2N7000 N-Channel FET, assert low from RP2040 → C64 control signals (/DTACK /CART)
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #* 2x edge connection plating, 32-pin top and bottom gold fingers
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #* 5x 100nF ceramic cap, (decoupling), ~$0.50
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #* 2x 20-pin female header, Pico socket, ~$1.00
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] ## GPIO connections
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc1 [gemini-3-pro] #For driving 5V Open Drain GPIO should Toggle between Output LOW and Input/High-Z with 2N7000
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #For reading 5V static input protect GPIO with 10K in series
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #For reading 5V CLK use 2.2K series + 3.3K to GND voltage divider
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] ### Megadrive Pinout
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- A1-A23: Address bus
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- D0-D15: 16-bit data bus
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- /CE: Cartridge enable (active low)
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- /OE: Output enable
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- /LWR, /UWR: Lower/upper byte write
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- /AS: Address strobe
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- /DTACK: Data acknowledge
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- /VRES: Reset
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- /TIME: Active when accessing A13000-A130FF (mapper/hardware register space)
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- VCC: +5V (multiple pins)
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- GND (multiple pins)
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- CLK: ~7.67MHz (NTSC) / ~7.60MHz (PAL)
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- /MRES: Active low reset output from cart
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #- /CART: Active low cartridge detect
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] ### GPIO Allocation
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #GP0, UART TX
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #GP1, UART RX
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #GP2, shift CLK
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #GP3, shift SH/LD
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #GP4, shift Q7 A0-A7
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #GP5, shift Q7 A8-A15
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #GP6, shift Q7 A16-A23
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #GP7, shift Q7 D0-D7
10aa5bc2 [gemini-3-pro] #GP8, shift Q7 D8-D15
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP9, shift Q7 Controls
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP10, latch D0, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP11, latch D1, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP12, latch D2, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP13, latch D3, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP14, latch D4, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP15, latch D5, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP16, latch D6, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP17, latch D7, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP18, latch CP lo, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP19, latch CP high, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP20, latch /OE, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP21, /DTACK, out, FET
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP22, /CART, out, FET
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP23, internal SMPS power save
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP24, internal VBUS sense
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP25, internal onboard LED
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP26, pwm audio right, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP27, pwm audio left, out
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #GP28, CLK, in, 2.2K+3.3K
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] ### Shift Registers (U1-U6)
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #Note:* All Shift Registers share common power (3V3) and GND.
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #Inputs:* 10kΩ series resistors on all parallel inputs coming from 5V Megadrive.
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* U1,74HC165,Shift In (Addr Low),GP4 (Q7),A1..A8,Parallel Parallel Inputs A-H
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* U2,74HC165,Shift In (Addr Mid),GP5 (Q7),A9..A16,Parallel Inputs A-H
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* U3,74HC165,Shift In (Addr Hi),GP6 (Q7),A17..A23,Parallel Inputs A-G (H grounded)
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* U4,74HC165,Shift In (Data Low),GP7 (Q7),D0..D7,Parallel Inputs A-H
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* U5,74HC165,Shift In (Data Hi),GP8 (Q7),D8..D15,Parallel Inputs A-H
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* U6,74HC165,Shift In (Control),GP9 (Q7),CTRL Lines,/CE /OE /LWR /UWR /AS /VRES /TIME /MRES
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* ALL_165,N/A,Clock,GP2,N/A,Common CLK for U1-U6
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* ALL_165,N/A,Latch (SH/LD),GP3,N/A,Common Latch for U1-U6
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] ### Latches (U7-U8)
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* U7,74LS374,Latch Out (Data Low),GP13 (SER),D0..D7,Outputs drive MD Data Bus
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #* U8,74LS374,Latch Out (Data Hi),GP14 (SER),D8..D15,Outputs drive MD Data Bus
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc3 [gemini-3-pro] ### Open Drain FETs
10aa5bc4 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc4 [gemini-3-pro] #> Logic:* GPIO HIGH = FET ON = Signal Pulled LOW (Active).
10aa5bc4 [gemini-3-pro] #> Components:* 2N7000 N-Channel MOSFETs.
10aa5bc4 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aa5bc4 [gemini-3-pro] #* Q1,GP21,GND,/DTACK (B31),Data Acknowledge (Active Low)
10aa5bc4 [gemini-3-pro] #* Q2,GP22,GND,/CART (B32),Cartridge Detect (Active Low)
10aa5bc4 [gemini-3-pro] #
