10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #Project Crumpet
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #A 16bit Sega Megadrive RP2040 hookup on plated 64 finger edge connector.
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #[USB] ─ RP2040 ─ 10kΩ series resistors ─ 6×74HC165 and 2x74LVC245 ─ cartridge port ─ [Megadrive]
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #description
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #Gangs of shift registers transport data between millenium.
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #basic rom cartridge logic
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #The RP2040 PIO empties shift registers in parallel = 8 cycles.
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #With address decoded and confirmation write cycle required, 16 bit data is prepared for bus.
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #The PIO writes 8 bits, latches the Low byte, writes 8 bits, latches the High byte, then enables
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #Output (/OE).
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #bom
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab716 [gemini-3-pro] #• 6× 74HC165 shift registers (2.10/12.60)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2× 74LS374 buffered latches (5.60/11.20)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2× 2N7000 N-Channel FET
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2× Edge connection plating (32-pin top/bottom)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2× 20-pin female header
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 5× 100nF ceramic cap (Decoupling)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 48× 10kΩ Resistors (Shift Register Input Series)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 1× 2.2kΩ Resistor (Clock Divider Series)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 1× 3.3kΩ Resistor (Clock Divider Shunt)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2× 1kΩ Resistors (Audio PWM Series)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2× 10nF Ceramic Caps (Audio PWM Filtering)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #GPIO connections
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #For driving 5V Open Drain GPIO should Toggle between Output LOW and Input/High-Z with 2N7000
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #For reading 5V static input protect GPIO with 10K in series
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #For reading 5V CLK use 2.2K series + 3.3K to GND voltage divider
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #Megadrive Pinout
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #- A1-A23: Address bus
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #- D0-D15: 16-bit data bus
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #- /CE: Cartridge enable (active low)
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #- /OE: Output enable
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #- /LWR, /UWR: Lower/upper byte write
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #- /AS: Address strobe
10aab717 [gemini-3-pro] #- /DTACK: Data acknowledge
