10b63db1 [claude-opus-4-5] ### luma2
10b63db1 [claude-opus-4-5] #C64 composite video capture via LM319 comparators.
10b63db1 [claude-opus-4-5] #2-bit greyscale, 320x200 @ 50Hz. Optional chroma/audio mods.
10b63db1 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10b63db1 [claude-opus-4-5] ### fifteen
10b63db1 [claude-opus-4-5] #Triple network bridge: C64 IEC serial, GBA link, Megadrive EXT.
10b63db1 [claude-opus-4-5] #Point-to-point wiring, no PCB required.
10b63db1 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10b63db1 [claude-opus-4-5] ### waffle
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #GBA cartridge interface. 32-pin, 3.3V native.
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #Direct GPIO connection, simplest PCB.
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] ### node
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #C64 user port interface. 24-pin edge connector.
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #8-bit parallel + serial via shift registers.
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] ### toast
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #C64 expansion port interface. 44-pin edge connector.
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #Full bus access via shift registers and FETs.
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] ### crumpet
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #Megadrive cartridge interface. 64-pin edge connector.
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #16-bit bus via shift registers and latches.
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10b63db2 [claude-opus-4-5] #
