10bc5a44 [gemini-3-pro] #Here are the details for the missing Apple II connections, the RP2040 button usage, and the
10bc5a44 [gemini-3-pro] #requested pinouts.
10bc5a44 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a44 [gemini-3-pro] #1. RP2040 SEL Button
10bc5a44 [gemini-3-pro] #The `BOOTSEL` button on the Pico is primarily for entering bootloader mode. While it can be
10bc5a44 [gemini-3-pro] #read by software during runtime (by toggling the flash CS pin), it interrupts flash execution and
10bc5a44 [gemini-3-pro] #can be tricky to use as a regular input.
10bc5a44 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a44 [gemini-3-pro] #• Recommendation: Use GP22* (which is currently free) for a dedicated tactile "Mode
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #Select" button. This allows you to cycle through mapping modes (e.g., 4-player independent vs.
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #2-player split) without resetting the board.
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #2. Apple II "Resonators" (Annunciators)
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #You are likely referring to the Annunciators (AN0–AN3). These are digital outputs from the
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #Apple II used to control complex peripherals (like the Koala Pad or digital joysticks).
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #• Yes, we can use the spare outputs on Latch U8 (Q4–Q7)* to drive these pins. This
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #makes your hub capable of hosting advanced Apple II peripherals.
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #3. WS2812B Meaning
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #The "B" in WS2812B stands for the Improved Version (Generation B).
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #• Protection: It has reverse polarity protection (won't burn out immediately if wired
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #backwards).
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #• Pins: It uses a 4-pin structure (VDD, GND, DIN, DOUT) compared to the 6-pin structure of
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #the older WS2812.
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #• Brightness: It offers better brightness consistency.
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #Project Joy (Updated)
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #Added Apple II Annunciator outputs and a dedicated User Button.
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #Updated Netlist
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a45 [gemini-3-pro] #GPIO Allocation
