10bc5a46 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a46 [gemini-3-pro] #Apple II Pinouts
10bc5a46 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a46 [gemini-3-pro] #DIP-16 Internal Game Socket
10bc5a46 [gemini-3-pro] #This is the socket found on the Apple II/II+/IIe motherboard.
10bc5a46 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc5a46 [gemini-3-pro] #╭─────────┬────────────┬─────────────────┬─────────┬────────────┬──────────────────────────────╮
10bc5a46 [gemini-3-pro] #│  Pin    │  Function  │  Description    │  Pin    │  Function  │  Description                 │
