10bc9427 [gemini-3-pro] #Yes, the "Resonators" on the Apple II are called Annunciators (AN0, AN1, etc.). These are
10bc9427 [gemini-3-pro] #digital outputs from the computer (or in this case, Project Joy) used to switch modes or drive
10bc9427 [gemini-3-pro] #simple electronics in the controller.
10bc9427 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bc9427 [gemini-3-pro] #We can map GP22 to a spare header or sync line, as `BOOTSEL` handles the button press logic
10bc9427 [gemini-3-pro] #internally.
