10bcc8fe [gemini-3-pro] #• 2× CD4051 Analog Multiplexers
10bcc8fe [gemini-3-pro] #• 24× WS2812B LEDs (Strip/Ring)
10bcc8fe [gemini-3-pro] #• 8× 10kΩ Resistors (Input Pull-ups/Protection)
10bcc8fe [gemini-3-pro] #• 1× 20-pin Header (Aux Analog)
10bcc8fe [gemini-3-pro] #• Connectors: 4x DB9 (Input), 4x DE9 (Output), 1x DIP16 (Apple)
