10bd69aa [gpt-5-nano] #- vintagekid.md
10bd69aa [gpt-5-nano] #  - New: lifestyle-style overview tying multiple projects (luma2, joy, fifteen, waffle, node,
10bd69aa [gpt-5-nano] #toast, crumpet) under a single studio/profile.
10bd69aa [gpt-5-nano] #  - Useful for documenting scope and cross-project relationships.
