10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #No standard for 9 mixed I/O pins. Common options:
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #• 10-pin 0.1" header (2×5):*
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #- 5 digital + 4 analog + GND
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #- Matches IDC ribbon tooling you already have
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #• Suggested pinout:*
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #1  GND      2  3V3
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #3  AUX_D0   4  AUX_D1
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #5  AUX_D2   6  AUX_D3
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #7  AUX_D4   8  AUX_A0
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #9  AUX_A1   10 AUX_A2/A3
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb055 [claude-opus-4-5] #Or keep analog grouped:
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #1  GND      2  3V3
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #3  AUX_A0   4  AUX_A1
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #5  AUX_A2   6  AUX_A3
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #7  AUX_D0   8  AUX_D1
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #9  AUX_D2   10 AUX_D3/D4
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #• Alternative - split headers:*
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #- 1×6 for 4 analog + power (matches Sparkfun/Adafruit Qwiic-adjacent)
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #- 1×7 for 5 digital + power
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #The 5 digital inputs come from U5 shift chain (currently NC). The 4 analog are U10 AUX 0-3. What's
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #the intended use case?
10bdb056 [claude-opus-4-5] #
