10bde328 [gemini-3-pro] #Hardware Implementation Notes
10bde328 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bde328 [gemini-3-pro] #1.  Sega Pin 7 Safety: Your note regarding DB9 Pin 7 is critical.
10bde328 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Atari: Pin 7 is +5V.
10bde328 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Sega: Pin 7 is Select (Input).
10bde328 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Risk: If you drive GP5 LOW (0V) while an Atari stick is plugged in (Pin 7 at 5V),
10bde328 [gemini-3-pro] #you create a direct short through the RP2040 GPIO.
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Mitigation: Ensure there is a series resistor (e.g., 220Ω - 330Ω) on GP5 to limit
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #current to ~15-20mA in case of a short, or use a polyfuse/switchable header as defined in your
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #notes.
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #2.  Shared Bus Timing:
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   The 74LS374 latches on the Rising Edge of CP.
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   The code sets the Data Bus (D0-D7) first, then pulses CP HIGH then LOW. Ensure the data bus
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #is stable before the rising edge of CP.
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #3.  FET Logic Inversion:
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Your spec: "Latch HIGH = FET ON = joystick line pulled LOW".
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   This is correct. When you write a `1` to the latch, the 2N7000 Gate goes high, Drain
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #connects to Source (GND), simulating a button press.
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   When you write a `0`, FET is OFF, line floats (High impedance), allowing the console
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #internal pull-up to register logic High (not pressed).
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #4.  Analog Mux:
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   The CD4051 inputs must not exceed VDD (3.3V). Since retro consoles often supply 5V on
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #potentiometer lines (e.g., Apple II), ensure the voltage dividers on the inputs (implied by your
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #protection notes) bring the max signal below 3.3V.
10bde329 [gemini-3-pro] #
