10bf366e [gemini-3-pro] #       Ideal for:* SD Card (SPI), Buttons, OLED Display (I2C), or a parallel output bus.
10bf366e [gemini-3-pro] #• GP27: (ADC1) - Analog/Digital
10bf366e [gemini-3-pro] #       Ideal for:* Additional audio channel (Stereo mod) or Potentiometer.
