10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #Updated BOM Check
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #You have the comparators and passives. To support the new features:
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #1.  Waveshare Pico-LCD-1.14 (The HAT version with joystick).
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #2.  1x Extra LM319 (Total 3 chips):
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Chip 1: Sync + Chroma.
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Chip 2: G0 + G1.
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #    *   Chip 3: G2 + G3.
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #       (Note: For G4 you might need a 4th comparator or use a single op-amp/comparator, or
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #stick to 16 colors/4-bit luma).*
10bf4b98 [gemini-3-pro] #3.  Audio Input: 2x 10uF Capacitors (AC coupling) + 2x 10k/10k voltage dividers (to bias
