10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #Strengths
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- 3.3V Native: No level shifting needed - cleanest electrical design
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- Reasonable IC Count: 3x 74HC165 + 1x 74LVC245 is manageable
