10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #Key Considerations
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #1. GBA Bus Timing
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #The GBA has strict timing requirements:
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- /CS (Chip Select): Must assert within specific window
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- Wait States: ROM can request additional wait cycles via WAIT signal
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- Access Time: ~120ns for normal ROM access
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #2. Bank Switching
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #GBA uses 16-bit address bus (A0-A15) but supports up to 32MB ROM via bank switching:
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- Typically uses A16-A23 via GPIO or external latch
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- Your shift register approach may be too slow for bank switching during active gameplay
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #3. Save Memory Support
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #GBA carts support various save types:
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- SRAM (battery backed)
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- Flash (64KB-128KB)
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #- EEPROM (512B-8KB)
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #Each requires different control signals and timing
