10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #Suggested Architecture
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #
10ca1a91 [deepseek-chat] #
10ca1a92 [deepseek-chat] #[USB] ─ RP2040 ─ 74LVC245 ─ [GBA Data Bus D0-D7]
