10ca1a92 [deepseek-chat] #                    │
10ca1a92 [deepseek-chat] #                74HC165 ─ [GBA Status/SAV]
10ca1a92 [deepseek-chat] #
10ca1a92 [deepseek-chat] #
10ca1a92 [deepseek-chat] #• Alternative Approach*: Consider using RP2040 PIO for:
