10cb7686 [nitro@ryzen5] the pcb is thinner for a gba cart?
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #Yes, the PCB for a Game Boy Advance cartridge is thinner than the standard FR4 thickness found in
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #most electronics.
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #• GBA Cartridge PCB Thickness: Approximately 0.8mm.
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #• Standard PCB Thickness: 1.6mm.
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #If you are designing a board to insert directly into a GBA console slot, you must specify
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #0.8mm thickness when ordering from your PCB fabricator. Attempting to force a standard
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #1.6mm board into the slot will damage the console's contact pins.
10cb778d [gemini-3-pro] #
