10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #Front-panel pot layout (2.0″ and 2.8″ versions)
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #Use the original 1701 bezel grouping: four knobs across the lower skirt.
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #Keep 5 mm shaft spacing so one 10 k Piher horizontal trimmer per grey-level comparator plus one
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #shared “contrast” (sync-threshold) pot.
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #        +---------------------------+
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #        |  LCD window               |
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #        |                           |
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #        |                           |
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #        +---------------------------+
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #        | [G4] [G3] [G2] [G1] [SYNC]   ← 5 × 10 k trimpots
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #        +---------------------------+
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #Rear-panel connectors (both scales)
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #Right-to-left on a 20 mm rear overhang:
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #[3.5 mm audio]  [RCA chroma]  [RCA luma]  [USB-C Pico]
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #Keep the pots on the main PCB; run 0.1″ SIL header to a tiny daughter-board that carries the RCA
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #and 3.5 mm jacks so the rear wall stays thin.
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #Same PCB artwork for both LCD sizes—just change the four mounting holes and the front-panel
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #cut-out.
10d0459a [kimi-k2-0905] #
