10d15f49 [nitro@ryzen5] ribbon to 5 trimpot assembly header
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #Here is the review of the Luma2 display options and the trimpot assembly integration.
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #SKU Decision: Go with the 2-inch (µ1701-2)
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #• Critical Conflict Found: The 2.8" Touch version is incompatible* with your
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #current GPIO allocation.
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #• The 2.8" Waveshare module hardwires LCDDC, LCDCS, and LCD_CLK to GP16, GP17,
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #GP18.
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #• Project Luma2 requires GP16, GP18, GP19, GP20 for high-speed parallel video
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #capture (Chroma/Luma).
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #• Verdict: Use the 2-inch version. It uses GP8-GP13, leaving the high-speed capture
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #pins (GP14-GP22) free for the LM319 comparators. Plus, the 4 physical buttons on the 2" unit are
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #perfect for a monitor OSD (Menu, Up, Down, Select).
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #Trimpot Daughterboard (Ribbon Cable)
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #To mount the controls on the front of the "Mini 1701" case while keeping the PCB fast and tidy,
10d16174 [gemini-3-pro] #move the 5 trimpots to a separate PCB connected via a ribbon cable.
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #• Ribbon Specification:*
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #• Wires Required: 7 (1x 5V, 1x GND, 5x Wiper Returns).
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #• Connector: 8-pin IDC (2x4) or JST-XH 8-pin.
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #• Pot Function: These adjust the reference voltage for the LM319 comparators.
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #Updated Software Link
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #Includes the verified 2" display pinout and the new trimpot header definition.
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #module.exports = {
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #	name: "Project LUMA2",
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #	sku: "µ1701-2",
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #	description: "C64 Luma/Chroma Capture & Mini Monitor",
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #	display: {
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #		model: "Waveshare Pico-LCD-2",
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #		size: "2.0 inch",
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #		resolution: [320, 240],
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #		driver: "ST7789",
10d16175 [gemini-3-pro] #		interface: "4-wire SPI"
