10d2ae33 [gemini-3-pro] #Received specifications for the "Vintage Kid" RP2040 product line. The documentation for
10d2ae33 [gemini-3-pro] #Crumpet, Fifteen, Luma2, Waffle, and Toast is detailed and
10d2ae33 [gemini-3-pro] #consistent.
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #Here are a few observations regarding the design choices and architecture:
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #• Crumpet (Megadrive): The separation of the read path (6× 74HC165) and the write path (2×
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #74LS374 + 74LVC245) is a robust solution for handling the 16-bit bus. Using PIO to drive the shift
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #registers in parallel (8 cycles) is essential to meet the timing requirements of the 68k bus.
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #• Luma2 (Video): The specific implementation of the Chroma mod—using PIO to count edges
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #within a ~280ns window rather than traditional ADC sampling—is a distinct and clever leverage of
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #the RP2040 architecture. The use of LM319 comparators keeps the BOM cost significantly lower than
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #dedicated video decoders.
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #• Waffle (GBA): The design correctly identifies the pin constraint issue. Using a single
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #74HC165 (U1) to offload specific inputs allows the RP2040 to handle the GBA's multiplexed AD bus
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #and control lines directly on the remaining GPIOs without running out of pins.
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #• Toast (C64): The extensive use of 2N7000 FETs for the control lines (/IRQ, /NMI, /GAME,
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #etc.) is the correct approach for safely interfacing with the C64's 5V open-collector architecture.
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #• Fifteen (Bridge): The integration of three distinct standards (IEC, GBA, MD) into a
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #single "Swiss Army Knife" device is unique. The passive voltage divider approach for inputs is
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #simple, though care must be taken with signal integrity on the faster GBA link lines.
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #The BOM standardization (reusing 2N7000s, 74HC165s, and resistor values) across the entire suite is
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #excellent for manufacturing efficiency.
10d2ae34 [gemini-3-pro] #
