10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #mentioned in your notes.
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #Conflicts Identified
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #• 1. Luma2 Capture Logic vs. 2.8" Display (µ1701-2.8)*
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #The 2.8" screen (Waveshare ResTouch) hardwires its SPI and Control pins to GP16–GP22. This
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #completely overlaps with your video capture inputs:
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP16: Needed for Chroma (2.8" uses for DC).
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP17: Needed for Key 1 (2.8" uses for CS).
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #• GP18–GP22: Needed for Greys G0–G4 (2.8" uses for SPI CLK, MOSI, RST, Touch IRQ,
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #Touch CS).
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #• 2. Luma2 Capture Logic vs. 2" Display (1701-2:13)*
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #• Status: Compatible.
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #• The 2" screen restricts itself to GP8–GP13 (Screen) and GP2, GP3, GP15, GP17
10d2c577 [gemini-3-pro] #(Buttons).
10d2c578 [gemini-3-pro] #• This leaves GP14 (Sync), GP16 (Chroma), and GP18–GP22 (Greys) free for
10d2c578 [gemini-3-pro] #your comparators.
