10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #The transition to a strict 1:6 scale for the "Miniature Range" appears to have solved the
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #internal volume constraints, particularly for the 1541 drive.
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #Here is a summary of the design updates based on the new scale:
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• 1. Scale Adjustment (2:13 \to 1:6)*
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• 1701 Monitor: The dimensions have increased slightly to 62.2 x 60.5 x 68.2 mm.
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #This provides ample internal clearance for the Waveshare 2" LCD (which is approx 41mm wide) and the
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #custom driver PCB with the LM319s and trimpots.
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• 1541 Drive: The "Twin Stack" concept at 1:6 results in a 32 x 32 x 80 mm unit.
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #       Width (32mm):* Fits the 28mm wide PCB and the standard DIN-6 footprint comfortably.
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #       Depth (80mm):* Perfectly accommodates the 74mm length of the "Node 1541" PCB plus
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #the DIN connector depth.
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• 2. BOM & Sourcing*
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• The Jaycar and Element14 links are correctly associated with the updated resistor and capacitor
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #audits.
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• The Project Fifteen BOM is now optimized for the "Node" PCB layout (inline DIN-6 ->
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #RP2040 -> Headers).
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• 3. Product Lineup*
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #The "vintage kid" portfolio is now clearly segmented:
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• Miniature Range (1:6): sku-L1 (Luma2) and sku-F1 (Fifteen).
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• PCB/Cartridge Range: Toast (C64), Crumpet (MD), Waffle (GBA).
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #• Standalone/Bridge: Joy, Node.
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #The files have been updated with the 1:6 specifications.
10d4308a [gemini-3-pro] #
