10d4b821 [gemini-3-pro] #GPIO Logic
10d4b821 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d4b821 [gemini-3-pro] #• Inputs (Reading 5V Bus):*
10d4b821 [gemini-3-pro] #Voltage Divider: IEC_PIN (5V) → 2.2kΩ → GPIO → 3.3kΩ → GND.
10d4b821 [gemini-3-pro] #Logic High at IEC (~5V) ≈ 3.0V at GPIO.
10d4b821 [gemini-3-pro] #
10d4b821 [gemini-3-pro] #• Outputs (Driving Bus Low):*
10d4b821 [gemini-3-pro] #2N7000 FET: Gate to GPIO, Source to GND, Drain to IEC_PIN.
10d4b821 [gemini-3-pro] #Logic: GPIO HIGH = IEC LOW (Active). GPIO LOW = IEC Floating (Passive High).
