10e3a7a4 [kimi-k2-0905] #   - macOS: `brew install zstd`
10e3a7a4 [kimi-k2-0905] #   - Ubuntu/Debian: `sudo apt install zstd`
10e3a7a4 [kimi-k2-0905] #   - Windows: `winget install zstd` (or grab the release zip and put `zstd.exe` on PATH).
10e3a7a4 [kimi-k2-0905] #
